  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "The diazonium salt of which of the following compounds will form a coloured dye on reaction with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi></math>-Naphthol in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaOH</mi><mo>?</mo></math>",
